# Production run log

Phase 3, plan 03-10. The production proof run: the dry run over the whole production
candidate set, the authorisation Saeid gives at the Task 1 checkpoint, the single
authorised execute, and the Studio walk.

No environment value, credential or connection string appears anywhere in this file.

