## Dry run

Command, run from the repository root:

```
npx tsx --env-file .env.vercel-prod scripts/translate-posts.ts --all
```

No `--execute`. Dry run is the default and is the only mode this command can be in: the
script has no flag that turns dry run on, and `--execute` is the single flag that writes
(D-14). The run reads production, makes no model call, and writes nothing to the dataset.
Exit code **0**. Captured stdout verbatim; stderr was captured separately and was empty
(0 bytes).

