- The draft was **not published**. It remains `drafts.23396d5b-5d90-461b-b9ba-d31768bc73a6`
  with the draft status, and the dataset-wide D-12 tripwire still reports 0 Farsi documents
  carrying the publish-cron status.
- The draft was **not edited or retranslated**, so the assertions captured under
  `## Verification` still describe the document as it stands.
- **No backlog sweep was started.** The 26-post sweep belongs to Phase 5.
- `content/fa-glossary.json` was **read but not modified**.

